{"pageProps":{"content":{"id":9396,"title":"Em três edições, 38 representantes de povos indígenas de todo o Brasil participaram do Mekukradjá","shortDescription":"Ao longo de três anos – de 2016 a 2018 –, o Mekukradjá – Círculo de Saberes reuniu no Itaú Cultural, em São Paulo, 38 representantes de 27 povos indígenas oriundos de todas as cinco regiões do Brasil","slug":"em-tres-edicoes-38-representantes-de-povos-indigenas-de-todo-o-brasil-participaram-do-mekukradja","content":"<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">Ao longo de tr&ecirc;s anos &ndash; de 2016 a 2018 &ndash;, o Mekukradj&aacute; &ndash; C&iacute;rculo de Saberes reuniu no Ita&uacute; Cultural, em S&atilde;o Paulo, 38 representantes de 27 povos ind&iacute;genas oriundos de todas as cinco regi&otilde;es do Brasil, configurando um verdadeiro <strong><a href=\"https://www.itaucultural.org.br/sites/mekukradja/\" target=\"_blank\">mapa da diversidade</a></strong> dos povos origin&aacute;rios presentes no pa&iacute;s at&eacute; hoje. Tradi&ccedil;&atilde;o, renova&ccedil;&atilde;o, cultura, identidade, linguagem e pol&iacute;tica s&atilde;o temas sempre em debate no evento, que, em 2019, acontece nos dias 22 e 23 de maio.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">No ano em que a 15&ordf; edi&ccedil;&atilde;o do encontro de lideran&ccedil;as ind&iacute;genas, o Acampamento Terra Livre, em Bras&iacute;lia, foi considerado &ldquo;a maior assembleia dos povos ind&iacute;genas do Brasil&rdquo;, o instituto reafirma a import&acirc;ncia de debater a resist&ecirc;ncia e as viv&ecirc;ncias dos povos origin&aacute;rios no mundo contempor&acirc;neo.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">Al&eacute;m dos <a href=\"https://www.itaucultural.org.br/secoes/agenda-cultural/mekukradja-2019-re-existencia-muitas-linguas-muitos-saberes#programacao\"><strong>seis ciclos de debates desta edi&ccedil;&atilde;o</strong></a>, o evento conta com&nbsp;uma feira de livros e de artesanato e a exibi&ccedil;&atilde;o de <strong><a href=\"https://www.itaucultural.org.br/secoes/agenda-cultural/mekukradja-2019-mostra-de-filmes-on-line\">quatro filmes on-line</a></strong> at&eacute; 24 de maio no site do Ita&uacute; Cultural.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><div class=\"video-frame\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xITG1V9q2KY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><br />\r\n<br />\r\nConhe&ccedil;a os povos que tiveram participantes nas &uacute;ltimas tr&ecirc;s edi&ccedil;&otilde;es do Mekukradj&aacute;:</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Bakairi\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Bakairi</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Umutina\" target=\"_blank\">Balatipon&eacute;</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Desana\" target=\"_blank\">Desana</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Guarani\" target=\"_blank\">Guarani</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Guarani_Kaiow%C3%A1\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Guarani Kaiow&aacute;</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Guarani_Mbya\" target=\"_blank\">Guarani Mbya</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Guarani_%C3%91andeva\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Guarani &Ntilde;andeva</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Kaingang\" target=\"_blank\">Kaingang</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Kambeba\" target=\"_blank\">Kambeba</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Karaj%C3%A1\" target=\"_blank\">Karaj&aacute;</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Kis%C3%AAdj%C3%AA\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Kis&ecirc;dj&ecirc;</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Krenak\" target=\"_blank\">Krenak</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Macuxi\" target=\"_blank\">Macuxi&nbsp;</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Maragu%C3%A1\" target=\"_blank\">Maragu&aacute;&nbsp;</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Maxakali\" target=\"_blank\">Maxakali</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Meb%C3%AAng%C3%B4kre_(Kayap%C3%B3)\" target=\"_blank\">Meb&ecirc;ng&ocirc;kre (Kayap&oacute;)</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Munduruku\" target=\"_blank\">Munduruku</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Patax%C3%B3\" target=\"_blank\">Patax&oacute;</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Potiguara\" target=\"_blank\">Potiguara</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Sater%C3%A9_Maw%C3%A9\" target=\"_blank\">Sater&eacute; Maw&eacute;</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Terena\" target=\"_blank\">Terena</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Tukano\" target=\"_blank\">Tukano</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Tupinamb%C3%A1_de_Oliven%C3%A7a\" target=\"_blank\">Tupinamb&aacute; de Oliven&ccedil;a</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Wapichana\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Wapichana</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Xakriab%C3%A1\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Xakriab&aacute;</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Xokleng\" target=\"_blank\">Xokleng</a></strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><a href=\"https://pib.socioambiental.org/pt/Povo:Xukuru\" target=\"_blank\">Xukuru</a></strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nSaiba quem passou pelo Mekukradj&aacute; em nossos canais no <strong><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/itaucultural/sets/mekukradja\" target=\"_blank\">SoundCloud</a></strong> e no <strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BE7kLD66t8A&amp;list=PLaV4cVMp_odz6HQTxtbmEG5ZmcrljHSsx\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a></strong>.</p>\r\n","publicationDate":"Publicado em 16/05/2019","publishedAt":"2019-05-16T21:25:00.000-03:00","publicationYear":2019,"updatedDate":"Atualizado às 20:36 de 13/07/2022","image":"https://s3.sa-east-1.amazonaws.com/prd.edito